{"id":"845d0e1921c301a4","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-universal-hashing.md","title":"Universal Hashing","display":"df-universal-hashing — Universal Hashing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-universal-hashing","aliases":["28-df-universal-hashing","Universal Hash Family"],"display":"df-universal-hashing — Universal Hashing","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"§8.2.2 Definition 8.14 background; printed p.152; PDF p.178","source_printed_pages":"152","source_pdf_pages":"178","source_status":"supplementary-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-universal-hashing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-universal-hashing</span><span>Universal Hash Family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal-hashing — Universal Hashing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§8.2.2 Definition 8.14 background; printed p.152; PDF p.178"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"152"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"178"},{"key":"source_status","html":"supplementary-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,R\">\\(D,R\\)</span> 为有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal H\\subseteq R^D\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal H\\subseteq R^D\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{\\mathcal H}\">\\(U_{\\mathcal H}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H\">\\(\\mathcal H\\)</span> 上均匀分布。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniversalHash}(\\mathcal H;D,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{UniversalHash}(\\mathcal H;D,R)\\)</span> 是碰撞概率型通用散列谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniversalHash}(\\mathcal H;D,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\left(x\\ne y\\Rightarrow\\Pr_{h\\leftarrow U_{\\mathcal H}}[h(x)=h(y)]\\le|R|^{-1}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{UniversalHash}(\\mathcal H;D,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\left(x\\ne y\\Rightarrow\\Pr_{h\\leftarrow U_{\\mathcal H}}[h(x)=h(y)]\\le|R|^{-1}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 §8.2.2 散列工具的碰撞概率接口补充，原书定义 8.14 明确给出的是更强的两两独立条件。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in R\">\\(a\\in R\\)</span> 求和可从 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d828bbffc0f86990\" href=\"?note=d828bbffc0f86990\" title=\"28-df-pairwise-independent-family\">28-df-pairwise-independent-family</a> 推出本条件；本条件不单独保证单点均匀。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-pairwise-independent-family","status":"resolved","id":"d828bbffc0f86990","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是 §8.2.2 散列工具的碰撞概率接口补充，原书定义 8.14 明确给出的是更强的两两独立条件。对 $a\\in R$ 求和可从 [[28-df-pairwise-independent-family]] 推出本条件；本条件不单独保证单点均匀。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D,R","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal H\\subseteq R^D","display":false},{"tex":"U_{\\mathcal H}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UniversalHash}(\\mathcal H;D,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UniversalHash}(\\mathcal H;D,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\left(x\\ne y\\Rightarrow\\Pr_{h\\leftarrow U_{\\mathcal H}}[h(x)=h(y)]\\le|R|^{-1}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"a\\in R","display":false}],"bytes":1173,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"随机散列：[[28-df-pairwise-independent-family]]、[[28-df-universal-hashing]]。"}],"outgoing":["d828bbffc0f86990"]}